  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Khar East known for?",
      "answer": "Khar East is known for its central Western Suburbs location between Bandra East and Santacruz East, easy access to the Western Express Highway and BKC, the Golibar and Nehru Nagar residential pockets, and being a quieter, well-connected residential alternative to the upscale Khar West."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Khar East?",
      "answer": "Khar East falls primarily under pin codes 400051 (Khar / Kalanagar belt) and 400055 (Santacruz East border / Golibar), within the H/East ward."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Khar East?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Khar East are Golibar, Nehru Nagar, Kalanagar (border), Khar Subway area, Daulat Nagar, Pipe Road, and the Vakola/Santacruz East border pockets."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Khar East?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Khar East range from ₹85 lakh for a 1BHK in Golibar/Nehru Nagar pockets to ₹1.6–2.4 Cr for a 2BHK near Khar Road station and Kalanagar, and ₹2.8–4 Cr for premium flats close to BKC. Rental rates range from ₹20,000 to ₹70,000 per month depending on the sub-area and flat size (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Khar East?",
      "answer": "Khar East is served by Western Railway's Khar Road Station (28 min to Churchgate), the Western Express Highway, proximity to BKC (10 min), BEST bus routes 210, 221, 313, A-71, and easy auto-rickshaw access. Bandra Terminus and the airport are both within 15-20 minutes."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are in Khar East?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals in and near Khar East include Hinduja Healthcare (Khar), P.D. Hinduja Hospital, Asian Heart Institute (BKC), Bhabha Hospital (Bandra) and several multi-speciality clinics along the Western Express Highway."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in Khar East?",
      "answer": "Notable schools in and around Khar East include St. Theresa's High School, Rajhans Vidyalaya (border), Bombay Scottish (Mahim/Bandra reach), MET Rishikul Vidyalaya and several SSC and CBSE options in the Golibar and Santacruz East belt."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Khar East?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Khar East listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy."
    }
